  {
   "id": 552598,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Reflect on a website or a mobile application that you frequently use or visit.\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\">\n<li>Discuss what you like and dislike about the website or mobile application. How would you describe its usability?</li>\n<li>If you have any dislikes, why do you continue to visit this website? Are there competitor websites, and how do they differ?</li>\n<li>Does the website or mobile application allow you to submit user feedback? If so, have you ever submitted feedback on the website’s usability? Why or why not?</li>\n</ol>",
